WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,300
The loss of the mountain top was led down

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,540
We have wasted all our efforts again

3
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,020
Let's go do other things first

4
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,060
Lose things and arrange them later

5
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,620
How can that be done?

6
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:18,860
What is lost outside is us

7
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,460
It took a lot of sacrifices to clear it.

8
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:22,220
I can go out in a few days

9
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,540
Now he is poisoned again

10
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,260
They must be responsible for us

11
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:31,660
What happens when you rest?

12
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,140
My wife is giving birth

13
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:39,470
You stay here and don't move around

14
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:42,040
Otherwise I will definitely kill you
